        "original_id": "4e9f9679-99b3-510a-9064-2009b36c0306",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Drew Gehling\n- Products: Bully (video game)\n- Roles: Dr. Pomatter, Gord\n- Organizations: Rockstar Games\n- Topics: Broadway, stage and screen acting\n\nFacts:\n- Drew Gehling was born on October 16, 1982.\n- Drew Gehling is an American stage and screen actor.\n- Drew Gehling is best known for playing Dr. Pomatter in the Broadway musical \"Waitress.\"\n- Drew Gehling appeared in Garry Marshall's \"Billy & Ray.\"\n- Drew Gehling voiced Gord in the video game \"Bully\" from Rockstar Games.\n- \"Bully\" was released for PlayStation 2 on October 17, 2006.",
